flowchart LR
  U[User utterance, consented]
  Gate[Consent + quota + request ID]
  Fanout{Route by approved experiment}
  Cascade[ASR -> transcript check -> LLM -> TTS]
  Native[Realtime speech-to-speech session]
  Transcript[Independent transcript/evaluation path]
  Align[Text alignment: word / kana / jamo]
  Policy[Evidence gate + correction policy]
  Reply[Reply to user]
  Evidence[(Evidence store: model/prompt/version, edits, review)]
  Human[Human audit / blinded evaluator]
  NoAudio[No persistent audio by default]
  ConsentStore{Separate research consent?}

  U --> Gate --> Fanout
  Fanout --> Cascade --> Policy
  Fanout --> Native --> Reply
  Native --> Transcript --> Align --> Policy
  Policy --> Reply
  Cascade --> Evidence
  Align --> Evidence
  Reply --> Evidence
  Evidence --> Human --> Evidence
  U --> NoAudio
  Evidence --> ConsentStore
